        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15333\">issue #15333</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This test, added to <code>tests/all/debug.rs</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">#[tokio::test]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">watchpoint_set_fuel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"nb\">Result</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">guest_debug</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">consume_fuel</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">r#\"</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (module</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (memory (export \"memory\") 1)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (func (export \"store\") (param $n i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        (loop $l</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          (i32.store8 (i32.const 0) (local.get $n))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          (local.tee $n (i32.sub (local.get $n) (i32.const 1)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          br_if $l))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (func (export \"fill\") (param $n i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        (loop $l</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          (memory.fill (i32.const 0) (local.get $n) (i32.const 1))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          (local.tee $n (i32.sub (local.get $n) (i32.const 1)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">          br_if $l)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    \"#</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"cp\">#[derive(Clone)]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">ZeroFuel</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DebugHandler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZeroFuel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </sp